The SDK includes or depends on third-party components that are licensed under their own terms,
listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES. Those terms govern those components, and nothing in this agreement
limits your rights under them.

8. Ownership, trademarks and feedback
AiZtech and its licensors own all rights, title and interest in the SDK. No rights are granted
